	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Red'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Cell’s Church'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜baaaaaaaang!!）'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'The door to the church slammed'
	R
	'open.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	!VAR0516 : 484!
	\L_07085:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, anyone here?!!'
	R
	'Hey!!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hngaaah!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Come out right now!'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜shuffle shuffle...）'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	!VAR0516 : 14!
	\L_07015:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, what is it?'
	R
	'Are you here to confess?'
	R
	'Or to pray...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'No, stupid!!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hngaaaaah!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'No, no.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... Then...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Yer in charge of this church,'
	R
	'ain’t ya?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, incompetent as I am...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Makes things easy, then.'
	R
	'Look.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'The man showed his palm to'
	R
	'Cell.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Um... I’m sorry...'
	R
	'I don’t know how to read'
	R
	'palms...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Who said shit ’bout readin’'
	R
	'palms?!! Money! Return the'
	R
	'money!!'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh... Um...'
	R
	'I don’t recall ever borrowing'
	R
	'money from you...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'We’ve got a note here sayin’'
	R
	'the owner of this church'
	R
	'borrowed money.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'Cell looked at it. The name of'
	R
	'the former owner of the church'
	R
	'was written on it.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s true that this person was'
	R
	'my predecessor, but...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Where’d they go?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'They’ve since deceased, so I'
	R
	'took over for them...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Then that means the job of'
	R
	'repaying the money’s moved to'
	R
	'you, don’t it?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'But...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'The amount was 50000 GOLD.'
	R
	'Cell was unable to pay that'
	R
	'kind of money.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Now show it to me!!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hngaaaaaaah!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Indeed, indeed.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Dohoho～～.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'But... But...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'If you can’t, then you’ll have'
	R
	'to vacate this church.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Look, says right here.'
	R
	'If the money’s not repaid, the'
	R
	'building’s to be vacated.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... It does, but...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, whatever.'
	R
	'We ain’t monsters or nothin’.'
	R
	'We’ll let you go for today.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Be sure to pay the money back'
	R
	'next time we come.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hngaaaah.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Indeed.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07093:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'The men left in the same'
	R
	'violent way they came.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'50000 GOLD, though...'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... What should I do,'
	R
	'God...?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'Cell weakly got on the floor'
	R
	'to kneel, and prayed to God.'
