	'Cell’s body.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, we’ll give you a week.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Really!?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, really.'
	R
	'But you need to sign this.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'The man took out a document.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
