	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'hotel here!!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hngaaaaaaaah!!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Indeeeeeeed!!'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'O-Okay...'
	R
	'I’ll sign...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Good, good.'
	R
	'Alright.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Consent that your debt comes'
	R
	'before your personal'
	R
	'security... Heheheh...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'While what Cell signed would'
	R
	'protect the church, it would'
	R
	'also soon cause trouble.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright... Looks like you’ve'
	R
	'done it...'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'50000 GOLD by next week, then.'
	R
	'Pay it off in full.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'If you can’t...'
	R
	'You know what happens, right?'
	R
	'Heheheheh...'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Hngaaaaaaaah!!'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Indeed, indeed.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t bother running, won’t do'
