	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'You okay, Cell?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Y-Yes...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Why did you do something so'
	R
	'stupid?'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Was it not obvious something'
	R
	'like this would happen hiring'
	R
	'those morons?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'W-Well...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Why did you do it?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Hoh, is Cell, servant of God,'
	R
	'hiding something??'
	R
	'Hooooh.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m not hiding anything...!'
	R
	'The truth is...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'...Cell told Rance about how a'
	R
	'demon tricked her into giving'
	R
	'it Chaos.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'I see. So you were trying to'
	R
	'get it back, then.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Chaos is something you'
	R
	'entrusted to me... And this'
	R
	'happened... I apologize.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'...Well, whatever. What’s done'
	R
	'is done.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'...Rance...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'If it was taken, just have to'
	R
	'take it back.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Way easier to tell me like this'
	R
	'than hide what happened.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'...Well...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'So don’t worry about it.'
	R
	'Alright?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜squish）'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Kyan!'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07069:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance touched Cell’s ass.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance... Please stop.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s the problem? I helped'
	R
	'you out, didn’t I?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'That has nothing to do with'
	R
	'this.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'...Ch, stubborn...'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, the most important thing'
	R
	'is that you’re safe. Now, how'
	R
	'about we go back?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'...Okay.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fdd:
	ZH 1:
	'Chaos, huh...? Will I have to'
	R
	'take it back myself?'
