	'     Cell’s Church'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m here, Cell.'
	R
	'How are you?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Good, I...'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance...'
	R
	'I heard that Milli is sick...'
	R
	'Is it true?'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Not even getting stomped on by a'
	R
	'herd of cows would kill that'
	R
	'girl,'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'but she got seriously sick.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'I was shocked.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'You shouldn’t talk about the'
	R
	'ill like that.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s fine.'
	R
	'I’m the King, I can do'
	R
	'whatever I want.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'...Um, give this to Milli.'
	R
	'I don’t know whether it’ll be'
	R
	'helpful or not, though...'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06ff9:
	ZH 1:
	'Cell handed Rance a bottle of'
	R
	'medicinal herbs.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'I think this medicine will be'
	R
	'able to relieve Milli’s'
	R
	'illness a bit.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Sorry you feel like you need'
	R
	'to do this for her, Cell.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'No, this is all I can do'
	R
	'besides pray for her'
	R
	'recovery...'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'Also, Rance.'
	\L_070e6:
	ZH 1:
	'I keep telling you this, but you'
	R
	'shouldn’t speak poorly of'
	R
	'someone suffering from illness.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_06fc1:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay, okay.'
	R
	'I’ll go bring this to her'
	R
	'right away.'
	\L_070e6:
	\L_070d9:
	\L_07031:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay... Be careful...'
